   "text": "香港條文引自 IRD 寄存嘅憲報修訂條例 PDF 同 2016 年制定本，未同 e-Legislation Cap. 112 綜合本核對",
   "applies_to": "provisions.json 全部；elements quotes slot=hk",
   "updated": null
  },
  {
   "id": "U2",
   "text": "Consolidated CRS 出版頁寫 \"adopted a set of amendments in August 2022\"，同 2023 年 6 月 8 日出版嘅 2023 Standards 有出入；原文照抄",
   "applies_to": "sources S3／S4",
   "updated": null
  },
  {
   "id": "U3",
   "text": "CARF reportable／partner jurisdiction 名單未公佈（IRD：\"The lists will be published and updated in due course.\"）",
   "applies_to": "rp",
   "updated": null
  },
  {
